Output demo/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1

Hide
Type "source /home/sebastiadev/Escritorio/cortex-cli/demo/demo-env.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Type "# Machine A — push Claude Code sessions to GitHub"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "cortex sync"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

Sleep 1.5s
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "# Machine B — pull and remap paths automatically"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "cortex pull"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

Sleep 1.5s
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "# One-time MCP setup — use cortex from Claude Code chat"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "cortex setup-mcp"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Sleep 2s
